{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/6ff0a7be473103e4d5b078c4f4f07148.avif?t=1767372712\" width=864 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dino Domino is a <strong>pixel-art puzzle</strong> game mixing <strong>pseudo-programming</strong> with<strong> turn-based battles</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/53b5f70599858b53a7b8f2e2c74f3910.avif?t=1767372712\" width=882 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first glance it\u2019s a simple turn-based tactics game: guide a tiny dinosaur to defeat enemy dinos. Yet the world is lethal\u2014razor claws, fireballs, and traps all threaten instant death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/37548da0853aead82389f96b3ddac41e.poster.avif?t=1767372712\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/37548da0853aead82389f96b3ddac41e.webm?t=1767372712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/37548da0853aead82389f96b3ddac41e.mp4?t=1767372712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/f9d768d194abb4bc9e20660e53394849.avif?t=1767372712\" width=882 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Dino Chess is far deeper. You can literally open the game\u2019s backend and edit modular code that governs unit behavior and the rules themselves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examples,Want the enemy\u2019s claw attack? Drag its [Claw] command onto your [Spacebar]. Press Space and\u2014slash!\u2014you now claw too.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/af3e1bdc00675299dce82d5d1bfe3560.poster.avif?t=1767372712\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/af3e1bdc00675299dce82d5d1bfe3560.webm?t=1767372712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/af3e1bdc00675299dce82d5d1bfe3560.mp4?t=1767372712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy camping in place? Feed it your own [Move] command and watch it march itself into a pit.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/b4dc8f519af22f7e91871fe1903708e3.poster.avif?t=1767372712\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/b4dc8f519af22f7e91871fe1903708e3.webm?t=1767372712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/b4dc8f519af22f7e91871fe1903708e3.mp4?t=1767372712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No coding background needed\u2014just drag and swap modules to bend the rules. Includes a helpful hint system to guide your programming journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/5d67cc5a363a1fffa1a2334a147befd8.avif?t=1767372712\" width=882 height=115 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling wild? Change [On Fireball Hit] from [Die] to [Heal]. Getting blasted now restores HP instead of ending you!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/a2809e5726701e5456ff8a400afe6957.poster.avif?t=1767372712\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/a2809e5726701e5456ff8a400afe6957.webm?t=1767372712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/a2809e5726701e5456ff8a400afe6957.mp4?t=1767372712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make fireballs heal instead of harm make enemies self-destruct or trigger absurd chain reactions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even more absurd, reality-bending combos await your discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/be52731de5a433a7f9b25b7e18cd04f8.avif?t=1767372712\" width=882 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120+ hand-crafted levels across 10+ chapters each introducing fresh mechanics and deeper pseudo-programming puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus bonus side levels and extra achievements to challenge yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your imagination, create incredible solutions to each level, and explore the secrets behind the game. Welcome to the world of Dino Chess!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here is porridge a solo indie game developer currently creating this project alone. If you're interested in the game please consider adding it to your wishlist! This means a lot to me thank you for your support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921050?t=1767372712","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921050?t=1767372712","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/3ca6f98fbf312770bcec3b4645eda99d84377297/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767372712","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/3ca6f98fbf312770bcec3b4645eda99d84377297/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767372712","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/6ff0a7be473103e4d5b078c4f4f07148.avif?t=1767372712\" width=864 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dino Domino is a <strong>pixel-art puzzle</strong> game mixing <strong>pseudo-programming</strong> with<strong> turn-based battles</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/53b5f70599858b53a7b8f2e2c74f3910.avif?t=1767372712\" width=882 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first glance it\u2019s a simple turn-based tactics game: guide a tiny dinosaur to defeat enemy dinos. Yet the world is lethal\u2014razor claws, fireballs, 