/span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy camping in place? Feed it your own [Move] command and watch it march itself into a pit.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/b4dc8f519af22f7e91871fe1903708e3.poster.avif?t=1767372712\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/b4dc8f519af22f7e91871fe1903708e3.webm?t=1767372712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/b4dc8f519af22f7e91871fe1903708e3.mp4?t=1767372712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No coding background needed\u2014just drag and swap modules to bend the rules. Includes a helpful hint system to guide your programming journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/5d67cc5a363a1fffa1a2334a147befd8.avif?t=1767372712\" width=882 height=115 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling wild? Change [On Fireball Hit] from [Die] to [Heal]. Getting blasted now restores HP instead of ending you!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/a2809e5726701e5456ff8a400afe6957.poster.avif?t=1767372712\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/a2809e5726701e5456ff8a400afe6957.webm?t=1767372712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/a2809e5726701e5456ff8a400afe6957.mp4?t=1767372712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make fireballs heal instead of harm make enemies self-destruct or trigger absurd chain reactions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even more absurd, reality-bending combos await your discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/be52731de5a433a7f9b25b7e18cd04f8.avif?t=1767372712\" width=882 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120+ hand-crafted levels across 10+ chapters each introducing fresh mechanics and deeper pseudo-programming puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus bonus side levels and extra achievements to challenge yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your imagination, create incredible solutions to each level, and explore the secrets behind the game. Welcome to the world of Dino Chess!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here is porridge a solo indie game developer currently creating this project alone. If you're interested in the game please consider adding it to your wishlist! This means a lot to me thank you for your support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Porridge"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/d0e52aa67b0cfea835c5af807671411d6c53bf1e/header.jpg?t=1767372712","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3921050